<title>BELGIUM: Swissair may write off Sabena investment.</title>
<headline>Swissair may write off Sabena investment.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swissair may write off its investment in its Sabena unit if the Belgian airline suffers further industrial disputes, Sabena said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Swissair's board of directors has given the authority to Swissair management to write off its investment (in Sabena) if they think it is necessary,&quot; Sabena's chief executive Paul Reutlinger told a news conference.</p>
</text>
